{
    "title": "Zaxbys",
    "description": "Craving Zaxbys saucy, flavor-full food? We have a NEW app to give your taste buds what they demand \u2014 fast. Our Zax Rewardz program puts all the Chicken Fingerz\u2122, wings, sandwiches, Zalads\u00ae, and crinkle fries you crave right at your fingertips. Just select your favorite local Zaxbys location if you want to pick up or get your order delivered with a few clicks. Earn points when you order and redeem them for exclusive rewards. Each dollar you spend earns 10 points towards delicious rewards. You'll be on your way to free food in no time!\r\nFeatures include:\r\nEarn 10 points per $1 spent. Pro tip: Save up your points for something extra special later.\r\nZaxbys delivers. Select your go-to delivery service in the app to have your cravings delivered straight to your door.\r\nSkip the wait. Place your order to grab in-store or choose curbside pickup \u2014 we\u2019ll have it ready when you arrive.\r\nSave your faves. We\u2019ll save your favorite orders and store locations for next time.\r\nUse gift cards. Whether you want to digitize a physical gift card or send an eGift card, you can do it all in our NEW app.\r\nFeeding a crowd? Our platters and catering options have you covered.",
